 capita, regardless of property type.\n","\n","UKHPI property-type prices are almost perfectly correlated with each other:\n","\n","\n","*detached vs semi: 0.99 / semi vs terraced: 1.00 / terraced vs flat: 0.99*\n","\n","\n","This means that the four variables measure the same factor, which is how expensive the local properties are.\n","\n","However, it also shows that the UKHPI property-type variables are not distinct enough to be interpreted independently."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"ef0ab3fb","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.030746,"end_time":"2026-06-22T22:37:59.454726","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-06-22T22:37:59.42398","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# 5. IHT vs Detached House Price (UKHPI)"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":39,"id":"dd452a9b","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-06-22T22:37:59.521578Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-06-22T22:37:59.519622Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-06-22T22:37:59.820115Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-06-22T22:37:59.817099Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.337105,"end_time":"2026-06-22T22:37:59.823787","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-06-22T22:37:59.486682","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stderr","output_type":"stream","text":["\u001b[1m\u001b[22m`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'\n"]},{"name":"stderr","output_type":"stream","text":["Warning message:\n","“\u001b[1m\u001b[22mRemoved 15 rows containing non-finite outside the scale range\n","(`stat_smooth()`).”\n"]},{"name":"stderr","output_type":"stream","text":["Warning message:\n","“\u001b[1m\u001b[22mRemoved 15 rows containing missing values or values outside the scale range\n","(`geom_point()`).”\n"]},{"data":{"image/png":"iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAA0gAAANICAIAAAByhViMAAAABmJLR0QA/wD/AP+gvaeTAAAg\nAElEQVR4nOzdeWATdd4/8O/M5E7aJE3Sg9JSekC5QUXkkhtvRV0PVkVdUURdV3f9qbuu+6y6\n17P7qM96gdeuuOvt7gMeKBRQDkFEQLmhFwVK7jT3nZnfH2Frk5Y2bdPMJH2//rH5djL5TKjN\nuzPz+X4pjuMIAAAAAGQ/mu8CAAAAACA9EOwAAAAAcgSCHQAAAECOQLADAAAAyBEIdg