"}],"source":["# 8.8 Plot excluding zero-IHT LADs\n","\n","iht_uc_eda %>%\n","  filter(\n","    iht_value_per_capita > 0,\n","    !is.na(uc_households_per_10k_pop),\n","    !is.na(iht_value_per_capita)\n","  ) %>%\n","  ggplot(\n","    aes(\n","      x = log_uc_households_per_10k_pop,\n","      y = log_iht_value_per_capita\n","    )\n","  ) +\n","  geom_point(alpha = 0.6) +\n","  geom_smooth(method = \"lm\", se = TRUE) +\n","  labs(\n","    title = \"Log IHT value per capita vs log Universal Credit household rate\",\n","    subtitle = \"LAD level; excluding zero-IHT LADs\",\n","    x = \"Log(1 + UC households per 10,000 residents)\",\n","    y = \"Log(1 + IHT value per capita)\"\n","  )"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"d6daa0ae","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.05425,"end_time":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.417212","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.362962","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["Chart Summary:\n","\n","Yes, the **negative correlation** between IHT per capita and UC Households per 10k residents is still clear even after removing the zero IHT values."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"46433d5b","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.052535,"end_time":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.522219","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.469684","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# 9. Universal Credit Households vs UKHPI and Land Registry sale prices"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":53,"id":"1421907a","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.63279Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.631217Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.665951Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.663749Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.094681,"end_time":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.669006","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.574325","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["# This section uses iht_uc_eda from Section 8.\n","# iht_uc_eda already contains:\n","# - LAD-level Universal Credit households\n","# - full LAD population denominator\n","# - UC households per 10,000 residents\n","\n","# We now join in:\n","# - Land Registry sale price data from housing_lad\n","# - UKHPI property type data from ukhpi_property_latest\n","\n","uc_house_price_lad = iht_uc_eda %>%\n","  left_join(\n","    housing_lad %>%\n","      select(\n","        lad_code,\n","        median_latest_sale_price,\n","        mean_latest_sale_price,\n","        unique_properties_sold\n","      ),\n","    by = \"lad_code\"\n","  ) %>%\n","  left_join(\n","    ukhpi_property_latest %>%\n","      select(\n","        lad_code,\n","        ukhpi_detached_price,\n","        ukhpi_semi_price,\n","        ukhpi_terraced_price,\n","        ukhpi_flat_price\n","      ),\n","    by = \"lad_code\"\n","  ) %>%\n","  mutate(\n","    log_median_latest_sale_price = log(median_latest_sale_price),\n","    log_mean_latest_sale_price = log(mean_latest_sale_price),\n","\n","    log_ukhpi_detached_price = log(ukhpi_detached_price),\n","    log_ukhpi_semi_price = log(ukhpi_semi_price),\n","    log_ukhpi_terraced_price = log(ukhpi_terraced_price),\n","    log_ukhpi_flat_price = log(ukhpi_flat_price)\n","  )"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":54,"id":"137a3497","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.777405Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.77573Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.815982Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.813952Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.097996,"end_time":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.818546","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-06-22T22:38:06.72055","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"data":{"text/html":["<table class=\"dataframe\">\n","<caption>A tibble: 1 × 8</caption>\n","<thead>\n","\t<tr><th scope=col>n_lads</th><th scope=col>missing_uc</th><th scope=col>missing_land_reg_median</th><th scope=col>missing_land_reg_mean</th><th scope=col>missing_ukhpi_detached</th><th scope=col>missing_ukhpi_semi</th><th scope=col>missing_uk